WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:02.936
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.960 --> 00:04.296
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.320 --> 00:07.536
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.560 --> 00:13.120
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.120 --> 01:31.080
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.240 --> 01:34.480
=Episode 21=

01:44.000 --> 01:45.060
I said,

01:45.860 --> 01:47.976
no member of the Xu family
is allowed in Xiangfan again.

01:48.000 --> 01:49.350
The Eleventh in the World.

01:49.500 --> 01:50.800
Wang Mingyin.

02:49.380 --> 02:50.380
Good enough.

02:52.950 --> 02:54.980
I lent the Divine Token to you.

02:55.380 --> 02:56.500
My hair can't be messy.

02:56.950 --> 02:58.380
And he isn't Wang Xianzhi.

02:58.630 --> 03:00.050
A wooden sword is enough.

03:07.550 --> 03:09.050
The Eleventh in the World?

03:09.750 --> 03:10.956
I'd like to see what fighters

03:10.980 --> 03:13.250
the world has to offer.

03:36.780 --> 03:37.780
You, again.

03:39.130 --> 03:40.330
I, Wu Liuding of Sword Tomb,

03:40.480 --> 03:41.480
came with Suwang Sword

03:41.730 --> 03:42.776
and asks for another fight.

03:42.800 --> 03:45.720
Suwang, the ancient sword that ranks
the second on the famous swords list.

03:46.080 --> 03:47.080
Where's the sword?

03:47.480 --> 03:48.900
You'll see it.

04:27.680 --> 04:28.680
Get into the carriage.

04:55.900 --> 04:56.930
Draw the crossbows.

05:06.530 --> 05:07.530
Release the arrows.

05:25.380 --> 05:26.380
Again.

06:10.500 --> 06:11.916
The one who controls Fujiang Armor
Soldiers in the back

06:11.940 --> 06:13.060
may be nearby.

06:13.450 --> 06:14.650
Be careful, everybody.

06:19.700 --> 06:20.700
During the fight,

06:21.830 --> 06:24.180
I'll try to freeze
Fujiang Armor Soldiers for a moment,

06:24.280 --> 06:26.120
and we do the best we can
to break their armor.

06:31.830 --> 06:33.480
If you perform Chixia Swordplay again,

06:34.350 --> 06:35.450
you'll be dead.

06:36.350 --> 06:37.676
I think it's a diversion.

06:37.700 --> 06:39.276
Elder Li is with His Highness.

06:39.300 --> 06:40.300
Don't worry about him.

06:42.500 --> 06:43.550
Save our people first.

06:44.100 --> 06:45.140
Go.

08:28.300 --> 08:29.300
Still alive.

08:33.130 --> 08:34.130
Wood poison!

08:34.500 --> 08:35.706
Wood poison!

08:35.730 --> 08:37.080
Beware of the Wood-armor Soldier.

08:37.530 --> 08:38.580
Wood poison!

08:38.850 --> 08:40.170
Beware of the Wood-armor Soldier.

08:42.100 --> 08:43.220
Which one is the Wood-armor?

08:54.680 --> 08:55.396
I smell sulfur.

08:55.420 --> 08:56.420
That's the Fire-armor.

10:00.830 --> 10:01.757
That's the Earth-armor.

10:01.781 --> 10:03.400
Watch out for his attack from the earth.

10:06.100 --> 10:07.326
They're all monsters.

10:07.350 --> 10:08.350
How do we fight them?

10:09.080 --> 10:10.306
Give me a little more time.

10:10.330 --> 10:11.330
How long?

10:11.700 --> 10:12.700
Wait a bit.

10:12.950 --> 10:14.030
Give me a little more time.

10:20.540 --> 10:21.540
Drop your crossbows.

10:24.050 --> 10:25.050
Draw out your blade.

10:35.880 --> 10:36.540
Go.

10:36.650 --> 10:39.880
- Charge!
- Charge!

10:58.380 --> 10:59.380
Again.

11:13.400 --> 11:14.400
Again.

12:14.180 --> 12:16.280
Don't worry about them, sir.

12:18.730 --> 12:20.776
How long do you think
you can stall me here?

12:20.800 --> 12:22.230
I'll try my best.

13:35.500 --> 13:36.700
Please stop, sir.

13:42.100 --> 13:43.700
It really is Suwang Sword.

15:46.680 --> 15:48.100
When will the Earth-armor come out?

15:49.150 --> 15:50.150
Be more careful.

15:50.180 --> 15:51.220
As if it's easy.

15:51.550 --> 15:52.670
How do we win if it goes on?

15:52.820 --> 15:54.180
The strongest Golden-armor

15:54.650 --> 15:55.680
hasn't shown up yet.

16:02.450 --> 16:03.056
Your Highness,

16:03.080 --> 16:04.037
it's urgent.

16:04.061 --> 16:05.476
I'd like you to grant me a weapon.

16:05.500 --> 16:06.280
What weapon?

16:06.400 --> 16:07.077
Chana Spear.

16:07.101 --> 16:08.621
The Spear King, Wang Xiu's
Chana Spear?

16:08.750 --> 16:09.806
How is it possible that I have that?

16:09.830 --> 16:10.830
It's in the carriage.

16:11.130 --> 16:12.506
I only need your permission.

16:12.530 --> 16:13.530
Okay.

17:41.280 --> 17:42.830
Snakes in Sleeves.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.000
You are Li Chungang.

17:47.700 --> 17:48.700
God of Sword.

18:23.280 --> 18:24.280
Shu Xiu!

18:27.530 --> 18:28.630
Give me some time.

19:42.330 --> 19:43.350
Stop him.

21:10.380 --> 21:11.380
Cuihua.

21:11.800 --> 21:12.580
Draw the sword.

21:12.780 --> 21:14.230
Sword, unsheathe.

22:00.150 --> 22:01.150
Go.

22:01.400 --> 22:02.050
Go.

22:02.300 --> 22:03.300
Go.

22:13.180 --> 22:15.180
I can't hold on much longer.

22:27.450 --> 22:29.330
If he doesn't die, we will.

24:40.180 --> 24:41.157
How much longer will

24:41.181 --> 24:42.400
the Earth-armor keep hiding?

24:44.100 --> 24:45.100
Oh, no.

24:45.830 --> 24:46.727
His Highness is in danger.

24:46.751 --> 24:47.830
Shu Xiu, quickly.

25:00.350 --> 25:01.350
Watch out.

25:27.400 --> 25:29.450
Making Immortals Kneel.

25:39.880 --> 25:41.326
The genuine spirit that my attack bears

25:41.350 --> 25:44.036
is to subdue all by means
of the heavenly power,

25:44.060 --> 25:45.916
wiping out the spine and delusion
of the incapable ones

25:45.940 --> 25:48.236
so they shall learn that
once I'm around,

25:48.260 --> 25:49.580
there's no immortal in the world.

27:51.230 --> 27:52.606
She hid her breath well.

27:52.630 --> 27:53.750
And she's a good fighter.

27:54.050 --> 27:55.926
Though Wang Mingyin
was severely injured,

27:55.950 --> 27:57.550
it still wasn't easy to kill him.

27:58.450 --> 28:00.080
Miss Hehe?

28:00.700 --> 28:01.700
What a weird name.

28:02.080 --> 28:03.080
You know her?

28:03.880 --> 28:05.780
Miss Hehe from the sauced beef shop?

28:05.880 --> 28:06.600
Yeah.

28:06.780 --> 28:07.780
That was her.

28:07.930 --> 28:09.030
How is it possible?

28:09.250 --> 28:10.800
What sauced beef shop?

28:13.980 --> 28:14.980
Hey.

28:28.830 --> 28:29.830
Is there a chance?

28:30.530 --> 28:32.880
She risked her life for you.

28:33.080 --> 28:33.856
Move her into the carriage.

28:33.880 --> 28:34.880
I'll try to save her.

28:36.300 --> 28:37.606
And the warriors of Fengzi Battalion.

28:37.630 --> 28:38.680
Please save them, too.

28:38.800 --> 28:40.750
I'm a swordsman, not a doctor.

28:47.030 --> 28:48.030
All right.

28:48.200 --> 28:49.200
I'll do what I can.

28:50.530 --> 28:51.530
Thank you, sir.

28:52.930 --> 28:55.350
Your Highness, watch out for
the Earth-armor Soldier.

28:56.700 --> 28:58.220
He came here as I expected.

29:05.140 --> 29:06.600
How did it go on your end?

29:06.800 --> 29:08.400
Wood and Fire were destroyed.

29:09.940 --> 29:12.350
The Fire-armor burned and blasted.

29:13.030 --> 29:13.940
Lyu Qiantang

29:14.050 --> 29:16.030
overly performed Chixia Swordplay.

29:16.780 --> 29:17.780
Sir.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.700
He's beyond saving.

29:25.800 --> 29:28.350
Please take care of Qingniao
and Fengzi Battalion, sir.

29:29.730 --> 29:31.060
I'll check things out over there.

30:00.080 --> 30:01.080
Your Highness.

30:27.930 --> 30:29.050
Do you have any last wishes?

30:34.750 --> 30:36.450
Please spare the lives

30:37.880 --> 30:39.530
of the remaining Lin people.

30:40.630 --> 30:41.630
Okay.

30:42.730 --> 30:43.730
You have my word.

30:45.830 --> 30:46.830
What about you?

30:48.620 --> 30:51.220
Do you wish to be buried in the
ancestral grave of the Lin family?

30:54.330 --> 30:55.850
I changed my surname.

30:57.000 --> 30:59.330
I don't get to be buried
in the ancestral grave.

31:01.180 --> 31:02.280
Cremate me.

31:03.150 --> 31:04.510
And spill my ashes into the river.

31:05.700 --> 31:07.300
When I'm dead,

31:09.280 --> 31:11.730
I don't want to see those things

31:12.050 --> 31:13.130
or people anymore.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.000
Hey.

31:21.180 --> 31:23.030
When I fought,

31:23.730 --> 31:25.530
I was ready to embrace death.

31:28.200 --> 31:29.200
I know.

31:33.700 --> 31:35.700
I ruined my family.

31:37.200 --> 31:38.330
In the end,

31:39.780 --> 31:42.140
even my family doesn't accept me.

31:49.800 --> 31:52.830
For people like me,
every second on earth

31:54.380 --> 31:56.180
feels like torture.

32:01.780 --> 32:02.780
I know.

32:04.980 --> 32:06.950
Have I kept my promise?

32:09.080 --> 32:10.850
You didn't get hurt, right?

32:18.700 --> 32:20.100
You've kept your promise.

32:21.380 --> 32:22.380
You live up to the title

32:22.900 --> 32:24.620
of the Third Graduate
of Palace Examination.

32:27.280 --> 32:28.280
For real?

32:29.480 --> 32:30.480
For real.

32:43.850 --> 32:45.600
The path of my life

32:47.580 --> 32:49.600
has reached the end.

33:00.180 --> 33:01.540
It's been so hard.

33:09.250 --> 33:11.150
Curse you, Your Highness!

33:11.300 --> 33:13.050
Curse you, the world!

34:11.950 --> 34:12.950
Grandpa Wei.

34:13.230 --> 34:14.230
Here.

34:17.050 --> 34:18.500
Cremate him.

34:19.430 --> 34:20.900
Put his ashes in an urn.

34:22.200 --> 34:23.200
Understood.

34:24.630 --> 34:25.730
I'll handle him.

34:26.030 --> 34:27.030
Your Highness,

34:27.250 --> 34:28.630
please return to the carriage.

34:32.020 --> 34:38.060
(Lin)

34:58.630 --> 34:59.630
The Golden-armor Soldier.

35:08.020 --> 35:09.226
The strongest Golden-armor

35:09.250 --> 35:10.500
attacks right now.

35:33.200 --> 35:34.300
Miss Hehe.

35:34.900 --> 35:35.956
(Miss Hehe, Killer) It is you.

35:35.980 --> 35:36.980
Yeah.

35:37.300 --> 35:39.436
I didn't expect that it was you
who delivered the message

35:39.460 --> 35:40.660
about Wang Mingyin to the inn,

35:41.250 --> 35:42.476
and that you'd save me.

35:42.500 --> 35:43.580
Twice.

35:45.400 --> 35:47.950
Your hand-blade is sharper
than a real blade.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.550
You survived the first stab

37:02.800 --> 37:04.880
because you're wearing the soft armor.

37:05.430 --> 37:07.180
But I should've killed you

37:07.630 --> 37:09.480
with the two kicks.

37:13.080 --> 37:14.636
Have you taken Wang Chonglou's
Dahuangting

37:14.660 --> 37:15.730
for your own?

37:16.480 --> 37:17.480
Miss Hehe.

37:17.530 --> 37:18.167
Hmm?

37:18.191 --> 37:19.650
Are we enemies?

37:22.130 --> 37:23.130
Not really.

37:23.430 --> 37:24.806
But someone paid a thousand taels

37:24.830 --> 37:25.830
for your life.

37:26.350 --> 37:27.540
The Lord of Jing'an.

37:28.430 --> 37:29.900
Why did you save me earlier?

37:30.800 --> 37:33.900
I won't get the taels
unless I kill you with my own hands.

37:34.030 --> 37:35.430
If you're killed by someone else,

37:35.900 --> 37:37.250
I get 500.

37:39.530 --> 37:42.480
My life is worth quite a lot.

37:42.600 --> 37:44.000
I've told you everything.

37:44.250 --> 37:45.380
You can die now.

37:57.350 --> 37:59.030
This isn't any technique
of blade-wielding.

38:28.850 --> 38:29.930
You're so heavily injured.

38:30.350 --> 38:31.600
Can you wield the blades again?

38:33.280 --> 38:34.380
Try me.

38:59.300 --> 39:00.300
Are you okay?

39:00.950 --> 39:01.730
I'm fine.

39:01.850 --> 39:04.030
I saw you perform Jian Jiuhuang's
swordsmanship.

39:04.730 --> 39:06.180
From the First Move to the Ninth,

39:06.350 --> 39:07.800
he taught me all.

39:08.080 --> 39:09.350
You practiced for long, right?

39:09.580 --> 39:11.430
It's your last resort.

39:11.580 --> 39:12.830
Is Qingniao okay?

39:12.930 --> 39:14.460
She survives. For now.

39:15.130 --> 39:16.280
Good.

39:18.250 --> 39:19.630
But you're going to die.

39:27.880 --> 39:28.880
Kiddo!

39:28.980 --> 39:29.980
Kiddo!

39:40.300 --> 39:41.706
Shroud our brothers' bodies

39:41.730 --> 39:42.730
carefully

39:43.200 --> 39:44.560
and send them back to North Liang.

39:45.730 --> 39:46.730
- Yes.
- Yes.

40:04.980 --> 40:06.100
Is she okay?

40:06.880 --> 40:07.880
You're awake.

40:08.600 --> 40:09.930
Her life was saved.

40:10.430 --> 40:12.260
I'm transferring genuine energy to her.

40:14.530 --> 40:15.740
It's great that she was saved.

40:17.530 --> 40:19.350
You care about yourself.

40:20.880 --> 40:21.930
Little Jiang Ni,

40:23.000 --> 40:24.380
if you attack me now,

40:25.000 --> 40:26.230
I'll be dead for sure.

40:27.380 --> 40:29.530
I lent the Divine Token to the old guy.

40:29.780 --> 40:30.820
I have no way to kill you.

40:32.550 --> 40:33.730
You can have it back.

40:37.600 --> 40:38.780
You're going to die anyway.

40:39.150 --> 40:40.550
It's unnecessary that I attack you.

40:45.350 --> 40:46.550
Is it that serious?

40:48.700 --> 40:50.780
Dahuangting isn't yours.

40:50.900 --> 40:52.476
You're lucky that the genuine energy
hid inside your meridians

40:52.500 --> 40:53.500
and was never dissipated.

40:53.780 --> 40:55.620
The girl made three fatal strikes,

40:55.680 --> 40:57.600
making your genuine energy run backward.

40:57.700 --> 40:58.980
Your chance of survival is slim.

41:00.930 --> 41:02.250
Who would have thought that

41:02.580 --> 41:03.880
a girl who sells sauced beef

41:04.080 --> 41:05.680
in Lingzhou

41:05.780 --> 41:07.140
is a killer?

41:08.300 --> 41:09.277
Back in North Liang,

41:09.301 --> 41:11.400
her sauced beef was my favorite.

41:12.480 --> 41:14.250
Still thinking about the beef?

41:16.200 --> 41:17.000
Sir.

41:17.180 --> 41:18.180
Hmm?

41:18.500 --> 41:19.980
Is there a chance for me live?

41:21.580 --> 41:22.580
Yes.

41:23.180 --> 41:24.226
I can save you now

41:24.250 --> 41:25.236
by removing your energy from your core,

41:25.260 --> 41:26.580
stripping you of Dahuangting.

41:26.700 --> 41:27.940
You may stand a chance to live.

41:28.400 --> 41:30.106
Then I'd be useless.

41:30.130 --> 41:31.950
It isn't yours anyway.

41:32.180 --> 41:34.820
Living without the genuine energy
is better than being dead, right?

41:39.550 --> 41:40.550
What's that sound?

41:41.700 --> 41:43.100
Sounds like cavalrymen.

41:44.630 --> 41:46.140
The Lord of Jing'an is coming.

41:53.350 --> 41:55.200
The cavalrymen came at last.

41:58.250 --> 42:00.000
Good for you, Lord of Jing'an.

42:07.400 --> 42:08.660
Keep alert, warriors.

42:41.080 --> 42:42.080
Your Lordship.

42:53.780 --> 42:54.780
Where is Xu Fengnian?

43:29.860 --> 43:32.580
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.350 --> 43:37.150
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.080 --> 43:42.000
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.080 --> 43:46.880
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.180 --> 43:51.080
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.780 --> 43:55.600
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.600 --> 44:00.360
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.380 --> 44:05.300
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.800 --> 44:08.536
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.560 --> 44:09.800
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.580 --> 44:14.440
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.250 --> 44:17.976
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.000 --> 44:19.440
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.930 --> 44:23.800
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.230 --> 44:25.576
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.600 --> 44:28.440
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.850 --> 44:31.336
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.360 --> 44:33.760
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.050 --> 44:36.076
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.100 --> 44:38.276
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.300 --> 44:42.520
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.880 --> 44:44.016
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.040 --> 44:47.080
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.250 --> 44:49.216
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.240 --> 44:51.960
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.520 --> 44:54.336
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.360 --> 44:56.856
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.880 --> 45:00.980
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
